        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind with the satisfying art of balance! In Steady Store, enjoy a peaceful puzzle experience where you arrange weighted items and discover helpful modifiers to create perfect harmony between two inventory grids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖️ <strong>Simple Weight Balancing</strong> - Each item has an easy-to-see weight value - just make both sides equal for that satisfying &quot;click&quot; of perfect balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Helpful Modifier Slots</strong> - Discover  modifiers that make puzzles easier to solve: double an item's weight, make heavy things lighter, or spread weight around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Relaxing Progression</strong> - Take your time with 48 gently escalating puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>No Pressure Gameplay</strong> - No timers, no penalties - just pure puzzle satisfaction at your own pace. Restart as many times as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 <strong>Multiple Ways to Win</strong> - Stuck? There's usually more than one way to solve each puzzle - find the approach that works for you. Use hints if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Clean, Soothing Design</strong> - Enjoy a calming visual experience with gentle colors and smooth animations.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind with the satisfying art of balance! In Steady Store, enjoy a peaceful puzzle experience where you arrange weighted items and discover helpful modifiers to create perfect harmony between two inventory grids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖️ <strong>Simple Weight Balancing</strong> - Each item has an easy-to-see weight value - just make both sides equal for that satisfying &quot;click&quot; of perfect balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Helpful Modifier Slots</strong> - Discover  modifiers that make puzzles easier to solve: double an item's weight, make heavy things lighter, or spread weight around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Relaxing Progression</strong> - Take your time with 48 gently escalating puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>No Pressure Gameplay</strong> - No timers, no penalties - just pure puzzle satisfaction at your own pace. Restart as many times as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 <strong>Multiple Ways to Win</strong> - Stuck? There's usually more than one way to solve each puzzle - find the approach that works for you. Use hints if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Clean, Soothing Design</strong> - Enjoy a calming visual experience with gentle colors and smooth animations.</p>",
